(2247519, 309567, 52336, '<td valign="top">The border is extremely distracting, in my opinion.  I keep wanting to look at the yellow mop rather than the hands.</td>', 'The border is extremely distracting, in my opinion.  I keep wanting to look at the yellow mop rather than the hands.', '2006-03-22 14:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
