(2248632, 309003, 45620, '<td valign="top">The picture is a little overexposed and so you lose the details on the arm and hand. Moving the flash further from the subject, or natural light from a window would help with that. It also appears to be slightly out of focus. Cool texture under the water though!</td>', 'The picture is a little overexposed and so you lose the details on the arm and hand. Moving the flash further from the subject, or natural light from a window would help with that. It also appears to be slightly out of focus. Cool texture under the water though!', '2006-03-22 18:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
