(2250424, 309446, 44611, '<td valign="top">I like this, particularly the colour treatment, but one thing is really bugging me.  No-one can hold their hands like this, so evidently the photo is rotated to show the hands in this composition ... but it just doesn''t come across as natural which is spoiling the whole thing for me.  Such a shame.</td>', 'I like this, particularly the colour treatment, but one thing is really bugging me.  No-one can hold their hands like this, so evidently the photo is rotated to show the hands in this composition ... but it just doesn''t come across as natural which is spoiling the whole thing for me.  Such a shame.', '2006-03-23 06:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250426, 309567, 44611, '<td valign="top">A great idea.  Love the colours and the potential depth of field.  Shame it hasn''t quite come off though - I think a bit more needs to be in focus in the foreground.   A shame, with the focus just right this would have been a top scoring shot.</td>', 'A great idea.  Love the colours and the potential depth of field.  Shame it hasn''t quite come off though - I think a bit more needs to be in focus in the foreground.   A shame, with the focus just right this would have been a top scoring shot.', '2006-03-23 06:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250427, 309261, 44611, '<td valign="top">What a shame the bacground is so distracting - had this been against a plain bg, I thing it could have been a real winner.  The odd red marks running from the top of the pear to the edge of the frame are weird too, they don''t seem to be part of the bg as they actually come across the front of the pear.</td>', 'What a shame the bacground is so distracting - had this been against a plain bg, I thing it could have been a real winner.  The odd red marks running from the top of the pear to the edge of the frame are weird too, they don''t seem to be part of the bg as they actually come across the front of the pear.', '2006-03-23 06:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
