(2250550, 309566, 30049, '<td valign="top">Something seems off in the color balance.  Maybe too warm?  Almost has a sepia tone to it but I''m not sure you intended that.  The background is distracting over the shoulder.  White, black, or light blue instead might have worked better.  With some different positioning that background could have been eliminated almost entirely.  It''s a unique approach to the challenge, just not quite right technically.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Something seems off in the color balance.  Maybe too warm?  Almost has a sepia tone to it but I''m not sure you intended that.  The background is distracting over the shoulder.  White, black, or light blue instead might have worked better.  With some different positioning that background could have been eliminated almost entirely.  It''s a unique approach to the challenge, just not quite right technically.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-23 08:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250558, 307864, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s different.  Wish the hand was in focus instead of the clock - or maybe both with more DOF would be best yet.  Lighting could be stronger (yet diffused), and a polarizer would reduce some glare on the clock face glass.  Compositionally, it''s too tight.  Need a little breathing room for the subject.  I like how you used a black background.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, it''s different.  Wish the hand was in focus instead of the clock - or maybe both with more DOF would be best yet.  Lighting could be stronger (yet diffused), and a polarizer would reduce some glare on the clock face glass.  Compositionally, it''s too tight.  Need a little breathing room for the subject.  I like how you used a black background.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-23 08:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
