(2251850, 309192, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  But sharpness on the subject = hands would be better, at least one hand really sharp would be good.  Bump up shutter speed, ISO if necessary to stop motion blur.</td>', 'Nice idea.  But sharpness on the subject = hands would be better, at least one hand really sharp would be good.  Bump up shutter speed, ISO if necessary to stop motion blur.', '2006-03-23 15:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251855, 309471, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Sharper with more DOF and brighter levels would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Sharper with more DOF and brighter levels would be better.', '2006-03-23 15:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251859, 309876, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice eagle.  Sharper with more DOF would be better.  Nice B&amp;W choice, but please consider adjusting levels so the image doesn''t feel too midtone gray.</td>', 'Nice eagle.  Sharper with more DOF would be better.  Nice B&W choice, but please consider adjusting levels so the image doesn''t feel too midtone gray.', '2006-03-23 15:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251877, 309145, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and interesting composition.  There''s just too much out-of-focus in-your-face foreground.  More DOF and cropped to reduce book edge would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea and interesting composition.  There''s just too much out-of-focus in-your-face foreground.  More DOF and cropped to reduce book edge would be better.', '2006-03-23 15:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251892, 309722, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Sleeves, especially on right, are too-much in-your-face.  More hand flesh exposure and crop for less of sleeves would be better.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Sleeves, especially on right, are too-much in-your-face.  More hand flesh exposure and crop for less of sleeves would be better.', '2006-03-23 15:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251894, 309597, 54747, '<td valign="top">Given the focus on the eyes/head, it would have been nice to have the entire focal point in the frame.</td>', 'Given the focus on the eyes/head, it would have been nice to have the entire focal point in the frame.', '2006-03-23 15:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251906, 309782, 44490, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC.  Looks like back-focus, as evident from the sharp lamp.  Focus on hands and less-central compostion would be better.  It''s possible that your camera can''t focus this closely, if so, back it up and crop in software.</td>', 'Welcome to DPC.  Looks like back-focus, as evident from the sharp lamp.  Focus on hands and less-central compostion would be better.  It''s possible that your camera can''t focus this closely, if so, back it up and crop in software.', '2006-03-23 15:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251909, 309564, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Sharper with more DOF and less motion blur, and less-central compostion, would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Sharper with more DOF and less motion blur, and less-central compostion, would be better.', '2006-03-23 16:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251939, 307698, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution, but didn''t get the disembodied mystery til the second viewing - hope other people catch it, perhaps a better title would help.  Focus on hand and more DOF would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution, but didn''t get the disembodied mystery til the second viewing - hope other people catch it, perhaps a better title would help.  Focus on hand and more DOF would be better.', '2006-03-23 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251957, 308329, 44490, '<td valign="top">Somewhat interesting.  I''m guessing that you''re saying the sculptor used hands and stone as an inspiration?  A little more crop of out-of-focus area would be better.</td>', 'Somewhat interesting.  I''m guessing that you''re saying the sculptor used hands and stone as an inspiration?  A little more crop of out-of-focus area would be better.', '2006-03-23 16:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251963, 309010, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Nice sharpness, DOF, and composition.  Hand is intentionally in-your-face, but it''s a little too dominant and annoying for longer viewing.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Nice sharpness, DOF, and composition.  Hand is intentionally in-your-face, but it''s a little too dominant and annoying for longer viewing.', '2006-03-23 16:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251970, 307377, 44490, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC.  Nice composition, cute hands and pose.  White canvas at top and bottom are annoying.  Sharper and more DOF would be better.</td>', 'Welcome to DPC.  Nice composition, cute hands and pose.  White canvas at top and bottom are annoying.  Sharper and more DOF would be better.', '2006-03-23 16:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251979, 309570, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Wish for better sharpness/DOF.  Better exposure of flowers would also help since they are so central to the composition.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Wish for better sharpness/DOF.  Better exposure of flowers would also help since they are so central to the composition.', '2006-03-23 16:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251988, 308632, 52299, '<td valign="top">Hands..?</td>', 'Hands..?', '2006-03-23 16:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2251989, 309401, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Nice B&amp;W choice, but please consider adjusting levels so the image doesn''t feel too midtone gray.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Nice B&W choice, but please consider adjusting levels so the image doesn''t feel too midtone gray.', '2006-03-23 16:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2252002, 309010, 20761, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, not too hot on the border tho...</td>', 'I like the concept, not too hot on the border tho...', '2006-03-23 16:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2252006, 309569, 20761, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, too bad it''s so hard to tell that it''s a climber</td>', 'interesting shot, too bad it''s so hard to tell that it''s a climber', '2006-03-23 16:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2252038, 307659, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness.  Less-central composition would be better.  The image needs a little more, how about really bright and colorful chalk.</td>', 'Nice sharpness.  Less-central composition would be better.  The image needs a little more, how about really bright and colorful chalk.', '2006-03-23 16:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2252096, 309858, 20950, '<td valign="top">"soooo cuuuutte.... bye bye!"</td>', '"soooo cuuuutte.... bye bye!"', '2006-03-23 16:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2252109, 308632, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the connection to the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t get the connection to the challenge.', '2006-03-23 16:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2252117, 307436, 54446, '<td valign="top">Superb detail and and exposure on the hand and watch.  I don''t like the train as much, because it has such different lighting, but I do think the train adds context.</td>', 'Superb detail and and exposure on the hand and watch.  I don''t like the train as much, because it has such different lighting, but I do think the train adds context.', '2006-03-23 16:57:06.000000', NULL, 1);
