(2252998, 307767, 53964, '<td valign="top">Good composition, fits rule of thirds well, not to mention challenge. Flash is bright tho'', the reflection off the nails is distracting.</td>', 'Good composition, fits rule of thirds well, not to mention challenge. Flash is bright tho'', the reflection off the nails is distracting.', '2006-03-23 22:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
