(2255371, 307722, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition, clarity, color.  I think that the additional element of a surfboard behind the hand would really make the shot.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition, clarity, color.  I think that the additional element of a surfboard behind the hand would really make the shot.', '2006-03-24 14:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255374, 309557, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, but the the poor focus lets you down.  also, the stuff iin the background right is distracting.  a differnet angle might hav improved this gretly - shooting the hand form more front on?</td>', 'a nice idea, but the the poor focus lets you down.  also, the stuff iin the background right is distracting.  a differnet angle might hav improved this gretly - shooting the hand form more front on?', '2006-03-24 14:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255382, 308918, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice colorful shot, composition, and action capture.  "Quick Hands" or something like that might be better for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea, nice colorful shot, composition, and action capture.  "Quick Hands" or something like that might be better for the challenge.', '2006-03-24 14:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255386, 309377, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, but it''s a bit too snaphot-ish.  and i know, sometimes that''s just what it is.  but if you cropped it tight to the hands, leaving out the doorframe or whatever on the left, and the top of the trophy, and th tops of heads, that would help.  i can see you are strugling with resolution, so perhaps your image won''t stand up to much cropping, but, better a good small image than a large mediocre one.  keep shooting!</td>', 'a nice idea, but it''s a bit too snaphot-ish.  and i know, sometimes that''s just what it is.  but if you cropped it tight to the hands, leaving out the doorframe or whatever on the left, and the top of the trophy, and th tops of heads, that would help.  i can see you are strugling with resolution, so perhaps your image won''t stand up to much cropping, but, better a good small image than a large mediocre one.  keep shooting!', '2006-03-24 14:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255388, 309782, 53572, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but the focus and the light peeping around the hand really pull you down.  if you don''t have macro, shoot from further away and then crop in.</td>', 'nice idea, but the focus and the light peeping around the hand really pull you down.  if you don''t have macro, shoot from further away and then crop in.', '2006-03-24 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255392, 309545, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, espcially with the colourful lights.  but, a closer cropped shot woudl be much more effective.  even just cropping on the lead guitarists fret hand woudl do it.  focus is a problem too.</td>', 'a nice idea, espcially with the colourful lights.  but, a closer cropped shot woudl be much more effective.  even just cropping on the lead guitarists fret hand woudl do it.  focus is a problem too.', '2006-03-24 15:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255394, 309767, 53572, '<td valign="top">a good idea, but could do with some cropping, and better focus.  cropping the arm on the right to get rid of the sleeve would improve this shot greatly.</td>', 'a good idea, but could do with some cropping, and better focus.  cropping the arm on the right to get rid of the sleeve would improve this shot greatly.', '2006-03-24 15:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255399, 308402, 53572, '<td valign="top">great hands, great idea.  but hte focus needs to be much sahrper, and that piece of wood on the left is distracting.</td>', 'great hands, great idea.  but hte focus needs to be much sahrper, and that piece of wood on the left is distracting.', '2006-03-24 15:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255405, 307173, 53572, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, and the composition is good.  but the flash is too harsh.  try to use ambient light with aonly a little fill flash.  most cameras have a portrait mode that has a lower level flash and lets you cpture the light around as well.</td>', 'i like the idea, and the composition is good.  but the flash is too harsh.  try to use ambient light with aonly a little fill flash.  most cameras have a portrait mode that has a lower level flash and lets you cpture the light around as well.', '2006-03-24 15:05:56.000000', NULL, 1);
