(2255416, 308153, 53572, '<td valign="top">if only that guy''s head wasn''t there!  moe contast might have made the crown=d in the background less obvious, focussing the attention more on the thrower and the ball.  they kind of get lost right now.  i''d crop off the top too, right down to the ball.</td>', 'if only that guy''s head wasn''t there!  moe contast might have made the crown=d in the background less obvious, focussing the attention more on the thrower and the ball.  they kind of get lost right now.  i''d crop off the top too, right down to the ball.', '2006-03-24 15:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
