(2255439, 307767, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, but the flash is way to harsh.  i don''t know what you''re shooting with, but if you can''t control the flash, just put your hand over it.  that will either filter a little light through, or block it completely.</td>', 'a nice idea, but the flash is way to harsh.  i don''t know what you''re shooting with, but if you can''t control the flash, just put your hand over it.  that will either filter a little light through, or block it completely.', '2006-03-24 15:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
