(2255446, 308508, 53572, '<td valign="top">a good idea, but the flash is too harsh.  try some ambient light, with a fill flash if really needed.</td>', 'a good idea, but the flash is too harsh.  try some ambient light, with a fill flash if really needed.', '2006-03-24 15:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
