(2259716, 309369, 48298, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea and very well-executed.  What''s bothering me about some of these hand/drawing images is that I thought photos were disqualified for showing artwork "not your own and including your own"?  I will go ahead and give you a high score, but I''m wondering about that.  Nice work, anyways!</td>', 'This is an excellent idea and very well-executed.  What''s bothering me about some of these hand/drawing images is that I thought photos were disqualified for showing artwork "not your own and including your own"?  I will go ahead and give you a high score, but I''m wondering about that.  Nice work, anyways!', '2006-03-26 11:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259717, 309915, 54446, '<td valign="top">I think this is interesting.  Just a little glare on the numbers at the bottom, otherwise, a very well executed long exposure image.</td>', 'I think this is interesting.  Just a little glare on the numbers at the bottom, otherwise, a very well executed long exposure image.', '2006-03-26 11:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259721, 309880, 48298, '<td valign="top">OK, it''s pretty funny, but I''m not focusing on the hands.  :)</td>', 'OK, it''s pretty funny, but I''m not focusing on the hands.  :)', '2006-03-26 11:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259723, 309559, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea.  The DOF plane needed to reach to more of the hand.  The focus is sharp on the most front of the saber guard, but not on the hand.</td>', 'Excellent idea.  The DOF plane needed to reach to more of the hand.  The focus is sharp on the most front of the saber guard, but not on the hand.', '2006-03-26 11:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259724, 307193, 48298, '<td valign="top">The time/date stamp blends in pretty well. :) It''s a cool composition and I like how the pen is pointing straight at us. I like the B&amp;W, too.</td>', 'The time/date stamp blends in pretty well. :) It''s a cool composition and I like how the pen is pointing straight at us. I like the B&W, too.', '2006-03-26 11:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259725, 309716, 54446, '<td valign="top">I totally do not understand.</td>', 'I totally do not understand.', '2006-03-26 11:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259726, 308211, 49865, '<td valign="top">i love the background on this one. really sets it apart from all the other clock pictures inthis challenge.</td>', 'i love the background on this one. really sets it apart from all the other clock pictures inthis challenge.', '2006-03-26 11:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259728, 309470, 54455, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the Christian content.  Nice background and lighting.</td>', 'Thank you for the Christian content.  Nice background and lighting.', '2006-03-26 11:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259729, 309635, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is great and fantastic detail, exposure and composition.  Magnificent!</td>', 'Wow!  This is great and fantastic detail, exposure and composition.  Magnificent!', '2006-03-26 11:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259730, 308950, 48298, '<td valign="top">My daughter just hid her eyes.  LOL  Probably nobody would be focusing on the hands in this photo.  I like that she is holding the flower and it would have really been better for the Challenge to zoom in a little...on the HAND.  ;)</td>', 'My daughter just hid her eyes.  LOL  Probably nobody would be focusing on the hands in this photo.  I like that she is holding the flower and it would have really been better for the Challenge to zoom in a little...on the HAND.  ;)', '2006-03-26 11:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259731, 309872, 54455, '<td valign="top">I love the concept!</td>', 'I love the concept!', '2006-03-26 11:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259734, 307875, 54455, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and contrast.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and contrast.', '2006-03-26 11:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259735, 309264, 54446, '<td valign="top">Exquisite detail.  I like the sepia tone.  Slight glare off the drum rim, but still very good overall.</td>', 'Exquisite detail.  I like the sepia tone.  Slight glare off the drum rim, but still very good overall.', '2006-03-26 11:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259739, 309383, 54446, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but the light is a little harsh.</td>', 'Interesting image, but the light is a little harsh.', '2006-03-26 11:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259742, 308796, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great color, clarity and emotional impact at this decisive moment.  Well done!</td>', 'Great color, clarity and emotional impact at this decisive moment.  Well done!', '2006-03-26 11:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259749, 307713, 54446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, clarity and exposure.  Really tells a great story.  Cropped slightly too tight on the top.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, clarity and exposure.  Really tells a great story.  Cropped slightly too tight on the top.', '2006-03-26 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259754, 308395, 54446, '<td valign="top">The green is a big negative here.</td>', 'The green is a big negative here.', '2006-03-26 11:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259758, 309569, 48298, '<td valign="top">Looks like hard work.  I can appreciate that.  I like the rough hands and the BandAids.  Color is a little off, so maybe it would have been better in B&amp;W.  Cool concept.</td>', 'Looks like hard work.  I can appreciate that.  I like the rough hands and the BandAids.  Color is a little off, so maybe it would have been better in B&W.  Cool concept.', '2006-03-26 11:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259766, 307767, 54446, '<td valign="top">The light (flash) is too harsh on the hands.</td>', 'The light (flash) is too harsh on the hands.', '2006-03-26 11:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259769, 308748, 48298, '<td valign="top">I love the tone and really love the detail and lighting on the old hands.  What''s keeping me from giving it a top score is the grain around the edges.  (Unless it''s an antique filter, but that would be against the rules.)</td>', 'I love the tone and really love the detail and lighting on the old hands.  What''s keeping me from giving it a top score is the grain around the edges.  (Unless it''s an antique filter, but that would be against the rules.)', '2006-03-26 11:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259770, 309569, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good action shot!  I like the composition very much.</td>', 'Good action shot!  I like the composition very much.', '2006-03-26 11:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259784, 308368, 48298, '<td valign="top">Cute.  But I can see his face more clearly than his hand.  Should have focused on his hand (and age 5) sharply and let his face be more blurred?</td>', 'Cute.  But I can see his face more clearly than his hand.  Should have focused on his hand (and age 5) sharply and let his face be more blurred?', '2006-03-26 12:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259799, 308164, 48298, '<td valign="top">Very special.  Cute.  Love the tone, comp, and the little jagged baby fingernails.  10.</td>', 'Very special.  Cute.  Love the tone, comp, and the little jagged baby fingernails.  10.', '2006-03-26 12:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259814, 309218, 50289, '<td valign="top">Love it!  This is what I expected from this challenge.  I''ve been disappointed.  Your''s is one of the best I''ve seen so far</td>', 'Love it!  This is what I expected from this challenge.  I''ve been disappointed.  Your''s is one of the best I''ve seen so far', '2006-03-26 12:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259832, 309716, 29408, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I could not make out what this was.</td>', 'Sorry, I could not make out what this was.', '2006-03-26 12:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259856, 309668, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I think I would work on the lighting next.  It could be brighter overall and some visible shadow cast down on the paper could serve to link the live action hand to the drawing.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I think I would work on the lighting next.  It could be brighter overall and some visible shadow cast down on the paper could serve to link the live action hand to the drawing.', '2006-03-26 13:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259862, 309782, 29513, '<td valign="top">I love the colors.  The soft focus is almost offset by the colors, but not quite.</td>', 'I love the colors.  The soft focus is almost offset by the colors, but not quite.', '2006-03-26 13:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259873, 307285, 29513, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the framing.  I don''t usually like borders of more than one color but here the border helps seperate your photo from the rest of the sculpture.</td>', 'I love the colors and the framing.  I don''t usually like borders of more than one color but here the border helps seperate your photo from the rest of the sculpture.', '2006-03-26 13:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259875, 309003, 29513, '<td valign="top">I just love flesh tones.  I would like to have seen this in color.</td>', 'I just love flesh tones.  I would like to have seen this in color.', '2006-03-26 13:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259879, 309528, 29513, '<td valign="top">I really like that the focus (figuratively and literally) is on the official.  I fitting protrait.  How many times has he stood there?</td>', 'I really like that the focus (figuratively and literally) is on the official.  I fitting protrait.  How many times has he stood there?', '2006-03-26 13:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259892, 309778, 29513, '<td valign="top">I really like all the colors that flesh can take on in different situations.  This is one I have not seen.  Well done.</td>', 'I really like all the colors that flesh can take on in different situations.  This is one I have not seen.  Well done.', '2006-03-26 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259908, 307436, 29513, '<td valign="top">You have a nice eye.  Well done.</td>', 'You have a nice eye.  Well done.', '2006-03-26 13:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259913, 307059, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot but I can''t help thinking how it would look in full color.</td>', 'I like this a lot but I can''t help thinking how it would look in full color.', '2006-03-26 13:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
