(2264759, 308919, 35804, '<td valign="top">This image captures perfectly that fragile "papery" quality of an older person''s skin...worn so thin from years and years of work and life...very nice.</td>', 'This image captures perfectly that fragile "papery" quality of an older person''s skin...worn so thin from years and years of work and life...very nice.', '2006-03-27 21:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
