(2264912, 309462, 51988, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and very creative! I did not vote on this but would have gave it a 6. I think if you wanted to improve this photo, just IMHO, I would have had the hand placed on black poster board. The current background allows for the white specs (lint, maybe) to be noticed.</td>', 'Nice composition and very creative! I did not vote on this but would have gave it a 6. I think if you wanted to improve this photo, just IMHO, I would have had the hand placed on black poster board. The current background allows for the white specs (lint, maybe) to be noticed.', '2006-03-27 22:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265208, 309580, 54979, '<td valign="top">I love this photo...and the title is well put.  I like how the hand is the center of this picture...nicely put.</td>', 'I love this photo...and the title is well put.  I like how the hand is the center of this picture...nicely put.', '2006-03-28 00:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265218, 309782, 41574, '<td valign="top">Did you intend for the shot to be out of focus? If so, I don''t appreciate the effect. If not, you messed up.</td>', 'Did you intend for the shot to be out of focus? If so, I don''t appreciate the effect. If not, you messed up.', '2006-03-28 00:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265219, 308950, 54979, '<td valign="top">This picture is really soft and sweet.  I really like the colors in the background and how it just goes with her skintone.</td>', 'This picture is really soft and sweet.  I really like the colors in the background and how it just goes with her skintone.', '2006-03-28 00:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
