(2268443, 309218, 16106, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the red. I have to disagree with your comments above about wishing the water could have been more frozen in it''s movment. I think the fact that the hands are more static makes them the focal point, if the water had not been slightly blurred, all those wonderfull colors and patterns in the water would have taken the focus away from the hands, it would have been a shot of water pouring over hands rather than a shot of hands in a stream of water. A subtle point I am making badly. Restated, this good, me like, more better this way.</td>', 'Congratulations on the red. I have to disagree with your comments above about wishing the water could have been more frozen in it''s movment. I think the fact that the hands are more static makes them the focal point, if the water had not been slightly blurred, all those wonderfull colors and patterns in the water would have taken the focus away from the hands, it would have been a shot of water pouring over hands rather than a shot of hands in a stream of water. A subtle point I am making badly. Restated, this good, me like, more better this way.', '2006-03-29 02:15:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2268450, 308888, 34685, '<td valign="top">Yes, it qould have been better with the finger dry. Would have minimised the reflection and also could have used some other background. <br/>Setup is a steel bowl of water and taping the finger in it. Shot taken when the finger comes off the water. Flash was used (builtin) hence the reflection.</td>', 'Yes, it qould have been better with the finger dry. Would have minimised the reflection and also could have used some other background. Setup is a steel bowl of water and taping the finger in it. Shot taken when the finger comes off the water. Flash was used (builtin) hence the reflection.', '2006-03-29 02:17:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2268470, 307433, 16106, '<td valign="top">Good to see you can make lovely shots without using all you PS chops. I like what you do in post processing, you have created a look that is pretty distinctive, and this is not it. It is sort of like a rock guitarist doing an acoustic set, nice in and of itself, and a nice display of range.</td>', 'Good to see you can make lovely shots without using all you PS chops. I like what you do in post processing, you have created a look that is pretty distinctive, and this is not it. It is sort of like a rock guitarist doing an acoustic set, nice in and of itself, and a nice display of range.', '2006-03-29 02:21:56.000000', NULL, 0),
