(2269321, 309391, 37879, '<td valign="top">I agree about the DOF...it''s actually too shallow.  Hard to tell what''s going on in the background.  Had you not posted in a thread, I wouldn''t have known.  Even if you stood to the right a bit more, there may be more detail in the faces where the hand is blocking any kissing action as it is.  <br/> <br/>I''m also not crazy about the selective color.  That pulls your eye to the foreground even more, which is what you don''t want since the focus is supposed to be on the "amour".  Also, how does the fact that someone has a blue shirt add to the image?  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but thought I''d add an IMO per your thread request.  Very creative idea!</td>', 'I agree about the DOF...it''s actually too shallow.  Hard to tell what''s going on in the background.  Had you not posted in a thread, I wouldn''t have known.  Even if you stood to the right a bit more, there may be more detail in the faces where the hand is blocking any kissing action as it is.   I''m also not crazy about the selective color.  That pulls your eye to the foreground even more, which is what you don''t want since the focus is supposed to be on the "amour".  Also, how does the fact that someone has a blue shirt add to the image?  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but thought I''d add an IMO per your thread request.  Very creative idea!', '2006-03-29 09:20:20.000000', NULL, 0),
