(2269954, 309600, 52336, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, though I only gave it a 5.  I think I scored it average because I thought the background would have benefited from being sharper.  I would have liked the background to have been darker, as in your <a href="//georgetipter.myphotoalbum.com/view_photo.php?set_albumName=album01&amp;id=DSCI2900_photomagazine" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">post-processed version</a>, which, had that been entered into a member''s challenge, I likely would have rated higher.  I''d like to have seen the hands pop out more, and maybe the red in them taken down slightly with curves.<br/> <br/>But I think it''s a good picture, and the intepretation is unique.  I haven''t voted often (I''m new), so I think I''ll take more into consideration in future.  Thanks!</td>', 'I like this photo, though I only gave it a 5.  I think I scored it average because I thought the background would have benefited from being sharper.  I would have liked the background to have been darker, as in your post-processed version, which, had that been entered into a member''s challenge, I likely would have rated higher.  I''d like to have seen the hands pop out more, and maybe the red in them taken down slightly with curves. But I think it''s a good picture, and the intepretation is unique.  I haven''t voted often (I''m new), so I think I''ll take more into consideration in future.  Thanks!', '2006-03-29 12:57:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2270047, 309600, 15711, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top 20. This was different and I appreciate the originality.</td>', 'Congrats on top 20. This was different and I appreciate the originality.', '2006-03-29 13:17:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2270079, 309600, 40718, '<td valign="top">I would have tried a less angled perspective and with the majority of the picture dominated by gray, I would have considered B&amp;W with bumped contrast.  Perhaps that would have gotten it to the Top 10, but who knows, right?</td>', 'I would have tried a less angled perspective and with the majority of the picture dominated by gray, I would have considered B&W with bumped contrast.  Perhaps that would have gotten it to the Top 10, but who knows, right?', '2006-03-29 13:29:45.000000', NULL, 0),
