(2270707, 309261, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is so neat! Puts a pear and a hand in shapes that they''re not normally seen in.</td>', 'Wow, this is so neat! Puts a pear and a hand in shapes that they''re not normally seen in.', '2006-03-29 16:10:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2270843, 308480, 17446, '<td valign="top">You didn''t make any major mistakes with this image (focus, lack of tonal range, bad cropping) I think it just lacks any "pop."  The hands are sharp and in focus.  They show good detail and aren''t blown out.  That''s all good.  But they''re posed in a strange way.  It''s a little confusing.  It''s unclear what you''re trying to say with the image.  I''m sure many voters said, "it''s just hands holding a steering wheel in an awkward way."  <br/>So all this is in response to you asking why the image did not fare so well.  Again you didn''t make any major mistakes with the photograph, it''s just a perplexing pose with slightly bland subject matter.</td>', 'You didn''t make any major mistakes with this image (focus, lack of tonal range, bad cropping) I think it just lacks any "pop."  The hands are sharp and in focus.  They show good detail and aren''t blown out.  That''s all good.  But they''re posed in a strange way.  It''s a little confusing.  It''s unclear what you''re trying to say with the image.  I''m sure many voters said, "it''s just hands holding a steering wheel in an awkward way."  So all this is in response to you asking why the image did not fare so well.  Again you didn''t make any major mistakes with the photograph, it''s just a perplexing pose with slightly bland subject matter.', '2006-03-29 16:43:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2270852, 309647, 10858, '<td valign="top">Oh my God, how can anyone say bad taste for this??? This is such a touching and delicate photo, which reaches my deepest corners of my heart. A little bit overneatimaged IMO, but this even cannot ruin the magical moment here.</td>', 'Oh my God, how can anyone say bad taste for this??? This is such a touching and delicate photo, which reaches my deepest corners of my heart. A little bit overneatimaged IMO, but this even cannot ruin the magical moment here.', '2006-03-29 16:46:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2270858, 309544, 47721, '<td valign="top">I want to thank every one that vote for my picture.<br/>I want to thank every one who gave me constructives comments... I realy appreciated...<br/> <br/>Now, I''ve saddly been disqualified... sniff sniff...<br/> <br/>Actually, I hadn''t read the "Editing rules"... to bad for me... but I honeslty loved that picture...<br/> <br/>I will try again<br/> <br/>Love<br/> <br/>Simpa</td>', 'I want to thank every one that vote for my picture.I want to thank every one who gave me constructives comments... I realy appreciated... Now, I''ve saddly been disqualified... sniff sniff... Actually, I hadn''t read the "Editing rules"... to bad for me... but I honeslty loved that picture... I will try again Love Simpa', '2006-03-29 16:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2270861, 308480, 49652, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that pictures of hands for this challenge needed to be inherently interesting and had to tell a story. I think because most people don''t hold a steering wheel this way, it was hard to conceive what message you were conveying.  I don''t get driving out of it.  It might have been more interesting with just the right hand, which has lots of interesting detail, not apparent on the left hand.</td>', 'It seems to me that pictures of hands for this challenge needed to be inherently interesting and had to tell a story. I think because most people don''t hold a steering wheel this way, it was hard to conceive what message you were conveying.  I don''t get driving out of it.  It might have been more interesting with just the right hand, which has lots of interesting detail, not apparent on the left hand.', '2006-03-29 16:52:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2270906, 309391, 35804, '<td valign="top">Hi Anil...and how interesting!...my nephew who is to be born in a few short weeks will have the same name as yours...Anil Kumar! A small world isn''t it?<br/> <br/>I am a huge fan of the very short DOF...as I mentioned in my comment made during the challenge, this is an image one needs to take their time with when looking at...enough time to allow the image to draw us, the viewer in and "see" the couple...for me, the focus on the knuckle empahsizes the physical embrace, the grip...and the image is all about the embrace, the moment...about two people sinking into one and other...it''s all about passion, but in a more cerebral level and not an "obvious" way which would have been more DPC friendly IMO. The toned down coloring was nice...full on color would have been distracting...maybe try another verion and give B &amp; W processing to see how the image evolves? I enjoyed the subtle "intimacy" of this image very much...hope I was able the shed some light on your placement....really 85 out of 281 isn''t all that bad in my book...it''s a fine image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-29 16:15:47.</i></td>', 'Hi Anil...and how interesting!...my nephew who is to be born in a few short weeks will have the same name as yours...Anil Kumar! A small world isn''t it? I am a huge fan of the very short DOF...as I mentioned in my comment made during the challenge, this is an image one needs to take their time with when looking at...enough time to allow the image to draw us, the viewer in and "see" the couple...for me, the focus on the knuckle empahsizes the physical embrace, the grip...and the image is all about the embrace, the moment...about two people sinking into one and other...it''s all about passion, but in a more cerebral level and not an "obvious" way which would have been more DPC friendly IMO. The toned down coloring was nice...full on color would have been distracting...maybe try another verion and give B & W processing to see how the image evolves? I enjoyed the subtle "intimacy" of this image very much...hope I was able the shed some light on your placement....really 85 out of 281 isn''t all that bad in my book...it''s a fine image.', '2006-03-29 17:13:58.000000', '2006-03-29 17:15:47.000000', 0),
(2270939, 309218, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Congratulations.</td>', 'Excellent!  Congratulations.', '2006-03-29 17:24:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2271078, 308210, 40667, '<td valign="top">11th place!!! Nice job!! Way too bad i didn''t get to vote on this challenge, because this definatly would have been one of my top pics! It''s crazy,(crazy good), i love it. Should be higher, but honestly, Can''t complain!! lol</td>', '11th place!!! Nice job!! Way too bad i didn''t get to vote on this challenge, because this definatly would have been one of my top pics! It''s crazy,(crazy good), i love it. Should be higher, but honestly, Can''t complain!! lol', '2006-03-29 18:00:41.000000', NULL, 0);
