(2271631, 309218, 11793, '<td valign="top">POW - dry hands to boot - superb - congrats !<br/> <br/>ps - if it wasn''t the on camera flash - try ''high speed sync'' - ISO 200  - 1/400th - f:5.6 ;}<br/> <br/>and/or up the flash exposure compensation for deeper DOF or even faster shutter.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-29 20:11:12.</i></td>', 'POW - dry hands to boot - superb - congrats ! ps - if it wasn''t the on camera flash - try ''high speed sync'' - ISO 200  - 1/400th - f:5.6 ;} and/or up the flash exposure compensation for deeper DOF or even faster shutter.', '2006-03-29 21:03:43.000000', '2006-03-29 21:11:12.000000', 0),
