(2271772, 307797, 41574, '<td valign="top">Thank you, all, for your comments.</td>', 'Thank you, all, for your comments.', '2006-03-29 22:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2271880, 309908, 43256, '<td valign="top">I told my husband I should have done both hands.  Oh well.</td>', 'I told my husband I should have done both hands.  Oh well.', '2006-03-29 23:17:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2271901, 309866, 5885, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=282283" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/437/thumb/282283.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/437/thumb/282283.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/437/thumb/282283.jpg"/></a> <br/>I''ve tried similar and like you I got hammered (pardon the pun).<br/> <br/>Anytime you delve into sexuality, religion or politics in your art, you are going to get a wide range of emotions from people (in our case voters). <br/> <br/>The way I have come to see it, is that when you try these images, if you don''t get reactions on BOTH ends of the scale, you haven''t done something right. Because, when you REALLY have some sort of message, people are going to love it or hate it.<br/> <br/>If you want a lot of high votes, shoot something pretty. If you want to make some sort of statement, be prepared for negative remarks.  <br/> <br/>I sincerely believe the BEST art isn''t pretty. Keep doing what you are doing, man. But, just start taking the negative comments as compliments :-)</td>', ' I''ve tried similar and like you I got hammered (pardon the pun). Anytime you delve into sexuality, religion or politics in your art, you are going to get a wide range of emotions from people (in our case voters).  The way I have come to see it, is that when you try these images, if you don''t get reactions on BOTH ends of the scale, you haven''t done something right. Because, when you REALLY have some sort of message, people are going to love it or hate it. If you want a lot of high votes, shoot something pretty. If you want to make some sort of statement, be prepared for negative remarks.   I sincerely believe the BEST art isn''t pretty. Keep doing what you are doing, man. But, just start taking the negative comments as compliments :-)', '2006-03-29 23:30:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2271910, 309866, 49202, '<td valign="top">okay, as i have started a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=369324" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a> on teh forum i.e. this entry, i think it would be proper to cap things here.<br/>thank you for the constructive positive comments and thank you for the constructive negative comments.<br/>to people who comment, keep on commenting. comments help newbie photographers like me better ourselves at our craft <b>provided</b> that your comments were well-thought of and not impulsive, like most of my comments here.<br/>thanks guys. i''ll definitely do better next time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-29 22:38:08.</i></td>', 'okay, as i have started a thread on teh forum i.e. this entry, i think it would be proper to cap things here.thank you for the constructive positive comments and thank you for the constructive negative comments.to people who comment, keep on commenting. comments help newbie photographers like me better ourselves at our craft provided that your comments were well-thought of and not impulsive, like most of my comments here.thanks guys. i''ll definitely do better next time.', '2006-03-29 23:35:57.000000', '2006-03-29 23:38:08.000000', 0),
(2271919, 307433, 22459, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, well deserved ribbon. Keep up the good work</td>', 'Excellent image, well deserved ribbon. Keep up the good work', '2006-03-29 23:42:53.000000', NULL, 0),
