(2271965, 309567, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the angle. Don''t care for the high key look. The shallow DOF would have been awesome if it had included BOTH hands, but blurred the rest. Still nice, though, I gave it a 6.</td>', 'I like the idea and the angle. Don''t care for the high key look. The shallow DOF would have been awesome if it had included BOTH hands, but blurred the rest. Still nice, though, I gave it a 6.', '2006-03-30 00:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2271968, 309647, 18367, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kloutit:</b></div><hr/><i> bad taste </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There is nothing in the world more natural than a mother nursing her child, and this image truly depicts the bond between mother and child.<br/> <br/>To suggest that this lovely photo, which cannot, even by the most generous of interpretations be considered (excuse the pun)... titillating...... is simply ridiculous.<br/> <br/>This is a lovely photo, and you should be very proud of it.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'Originally posted by kloutit: bad taste   There is nothing in the world more natural than a mother nursing her child, and this image truly depicts the bond between mother and child. To suggest that this lovely photo, which cannot, even by the most generous of interpretations be considered (excuse the pun)... titillating...... is simply ridiculous. This is a lovely photo, and you should be very proud of it. Ray', '2006-03-30 00:10:19.000000', NULL, 0),
