(2641793, 307909, 46314, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. <br/>I think it probably didn''t do so well in the Hands challenge because the hands aren''t really emphasised. Maybe a lower angle from just underneath the hands, with less of the face in focus, so that the hands are given more importance, would have been better for this challenge.<br/>But outside of the challenge it is a really nice photograph. Very expressive. In a portrait challenge it probably would have done very well.<br/>Good work.</td>', 'This is a great shot. I think it probably didn''t do so well in the Hands challenge because the hands aren''t really emphasised. Maybe a lower angle from just underneath the hands, with less of the face in focus, so that the hands are given more importance, would have been better for this challenge.But outside of the challenge it is a really nice photograph. Very expressive. In a portrait challenge it probably would have done very well.Good work.', '2006-07-20 09:46:05.000000', NULL, 0),
