(3359617, 307909, 48471, '<td valign="top">I like how the moving hand add dynamism to the stoic eyes of this man. A very good expressive photograph. In contrast to another commenter, I don''t like the wall and would loved if it was blurred. The hat and the clothes give me the information I need to know about the environment of this person, so I don''t need to wall, which I find redundant.<br/>What I don''t like is the desaturated colours: I wish there were more colour or none at all.<br/>Anyhow, a very good photo.</td>', 'I like how the moving hand add dynamism to the stoic eyes of this man. A very good expressive photograph. In contrast to another commenter, I don''t like the wall and would loved if it was blurred. The hat and the clothes give me the information I need to know about the environment of this person, so I don''t need to wall, which I find redundant.What I don''t like is the desaturated colours: I wish there were more colour or none at all.Anyhow, a very good photo.', '2007-02-13 00:10:11.000000', NULL, 0),
